# The Pixies prevent noncombat damage from their controller's Walking Ballista and combat damage from an opposing Memnite.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Argothian Pixies
Walking Ballista
Forest x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Argothian Pixies.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Walking Ballista.Cast(X: 1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Walking Ballista.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Argothian Pixies; Ability: Remove)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Argothian Pixies.Damage = 0
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Memnite > Bot1)
Bot1.Block(Argothian Pixies > Memnite)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Argothian Pixies.Damage = 0
Bot2.Graveyard = Memnite
